      "name": "Fumoffu",
      "overview": "Sousuke\u2019s going to high school, and all the qualities that make him a good soldier also make him an amazingly awkward classmate. Poor Kaname knows that better than anyone, since Sousuke\u2019s her undercover bodyguard. But how \u201Ctop secret\u201D can he really be when he\u2019s sneaking around in a teddy bear suit, blowing up lockers, striking out with every girl in sight, and taking a mech to the hot springs?",
